{
  "case_id": "MEGAS-CAP-1.20.1",
  "title": "机械师立牌(megas)「每消耗 2 张卡牌 +1 次轰炸（上限 10 次）」上限取证：30 张卡 => 未封顶值 floor(30/2)=15 被收敛到 10 => 总伤害 = 10x2 + 精准打击 (1+...+10) = 20+55 = 75 => 靶 500->425；层数 prec 亦应为 10（= 被轰炸次数）。",
  "version": "1.20.1",
  "target": {
    "type": "new",
    "ref": "megas_sign"
  },
  "on_fail": "keep_game_running",
  "steps": [
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "目的：机械师立牌(megas)「轨道轰炸 / 物资补充 / 精准打击」游戏内取证。\n本用例组由探针 megas* 系列驱动，**只调产品公开函数**（MegasSignItem / OrbitalBombardmentManager / PrecisionStrikeEffect / ModAttachments），断言锚定 latest.log 的 AP_<tag>_MEGAS 机器行。\n\n**期望值均按产品常量独立推算**（不读产品的中间量）：RADIUS=12、BASE_DAMAGE=2、MAX_STRIKES=10、\nPRECISION_THRESHOLD=6、COST_DAMAGE_MULTIPLIER=2、STRIKE_INTERVAL=20t、FALL=12t、合计单轮约 32t；\n主动冷却 120s=2400t；被动间隔 1200t、阈值 6 张。\n  次数 strikes = min(floor(消耗卡牌数 / 2), 10)；\n  单轮伤害 = BASE(2) + 战斗牌费用总和 x2；若有「精准打击」则该轮再 + 当前层数；\n  总伤害 = strikes x per + (precision ? strikes x (strikes+1)/2 : 0)。\n\n**场景控制**：doMobSpawning false（仅本用例内，末尾恢复）避免自然刷怪混入目标池；\n探针读数里的 near（指定靶 12 格内存活实体数）恒应为 1 —— 若被污染则**响亮失败**，\n不把伤害平摊当成功。\n\nWARN 冷却写在 TargetSelectionAction#apply 内 => 只有 megascast confirm 档能验冷却；\nWARN 轰炸异步（每轮 20t 间隔 + 12t 下落）=> 伤害/层数必须在用例侧 wait 之后读。"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/gamemode survival",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 800
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/gamerule naturalRegeneration false",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 600
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/gamerule doMobSpawning false",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 600
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/kill @e[type=!player,distance=..128]",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 700
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/tp @s ~ ~ ~ 0 0",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 600
    },
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "次数上限：30 张效果牌 => 未封顶值 floor(30/2)=15 > 上限 10 => strikes=10；\n  per=2(效果牌无费用)；30>=6 => 触发精准打击 => 总伤害 = 10x2 + (1+...+10) = 20+55 = 75 => 靶 500->425。\n  时长 = 9x32t + 12t = 300t = 15s => 等待 20s 后读数。\n  WARN 该相位同时验证「上限 10」与「高卡数下精准打击层数封顶于 strikes(=10)」。"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/clear @s",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 500
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/give @s astral_dice:effect_card_hamburger 30",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 800
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe megasprep K0 500 0",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 1300
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe megascd K1 fresh",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 800
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe megasread K2 PRE",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 800
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe megascast K3 confirm",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 1200
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 20000
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe megasread K3 AFTER",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 800
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe megasclear ZZ9",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 800
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/gamerule doMobSpawning true",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 500
    }
  ],
  "asserts": [
    {
      "type": "log",
      "source": "latest",
      "pattern": "AP_K2_MEGAS:phase=PRE:[^\\n]*:hand=30:[^\\n]*:dummy=500/500:[^\\n]*:near=1:"
    },
    {
      "type": "log",
      "source": "latest",
      "pattern": "AP_K3_MEGAS:phase=AFTER:[^\\n]*:hand=0:[^\\n]*:dummy=425/500:prec=10:"
    },
    {
      "type": "absent",
